add('js', 18, 2, 'Matthew Henry', 'Josué 18:2 — Matthew Henry: Here, I. Joshua reproves those tribes which were yet unsettled that they did not bestir themselves to gain a settlement in the land which Deus...', 'teologico', 'resumo');
